# (envelope fix round, HEAD, glasswing.py) D62 (round 4b, glasswing2.py): the glass winged helm (Thaerglass and every GLASS alloy wearing
# the messenger): a tall glass bascinet in two panes set in river silver (the centre rib, the brow band, the nasal), the panes
# one plane of dark glass so the glass pass lights their top-left edge and lays the cold rim down the lower-right inside
# edge, outside W7's face box; two straight glass blades on the dome's sides, widest at the root and dead straight to a
# hard 1 px point, lit on both edges with a dark core. Metal alloys keep the messenger below.
